    <title>用 Hexo + GitHub Pages 搭建免费个人博客（完整步骤）</title>
    <link href="https://zswzsw0.github.io/myblog/2026/10/31/hexo-github-pages-guide/"/>
    <id>https://zswzsw0.github.io/myblog/2026/10/31/hexo-github-pages-guide/</id>
    <published>2026-10-31T08:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-31T08:13:53.113Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>本文记录这套博客从零到上线的完整流程，适合完全没接触过 Hexo 的人照做。</p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="一、整体架构">一、整体架构</h2><p>写作只发生在本机：Markdown 文章由 Hexo 在本地渲染成静态 HTML，再把生成好的 <code>public/</code> 目录推送到 GitHub 仓库的一个分支，GitHub Pages 负责对外提供访问。</p><p><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Markdown 源文件</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mover><mo stretchy="true" minsize="3.0em">→</mo><mpadded width="+0.6em" lspace="0.3em"><mtext> Hexo 生成 </mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>静态 HTML</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mover><mo stretchy="true" minsize="3.0em">→</mo><mpadded width="+0.6em" lspace="0.3em"><mtext> git push </mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>GitHub Pages</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Markdown 源文件} \;\xrightarrow{\ \text{Hexo 生成}\ }\; \text{静态 HTML} \;\xrightarrow{\ \text{git push}\ }\; \text{GitHub Pages}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Markdown </span><span class="mord cjk_fallback">源文件</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel x-arrow"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.1003em;"><span style="top:-3.322em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mspace mtight"><span class="mtight"> </span></span><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">Hexo </span><span class="mord cjk_fallback mtight">生成</span></span><span class="mspace mtight"><span class="mtight"> </span></span></span></span></span><span class="svg-align" style="top:-2.689em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="hide-tail" style="height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="400em" height="0.522em" viewBox="0 0 400000 522" preserveAspectRatio="xMaxYMin slice"><path d="M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z"/></svg></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.011em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord cjk_fallback">静态</span><span class="mord"> HTML</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel x-arrow"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.1081em;"><span style="top:-3.322em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mspace mtight"><span class="mtight"> </span></span><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">git push</span></span><span class="mspace mtight"><span class="mtight"> </span></span></span></span></span><span class="svg-align" style="top:-2.689em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="hide-tail" style="height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="400em" height="0.522em" viewBox="0 0 400000 522" preserveAspectRatio="xMaxYMin slice"><path d="M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z"/></svg></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.011em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">GitHub Pages</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>好处是：服务器、数据库、域名全部不需要，访问速度快且永久免费。</p><h2 id="二、准备工作">二、准备工作</h2><table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>要求</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Node.js</td><td><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ge 18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;"></span><span class="mrel">≥</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">18</span></span></span></span>，本机已验证 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mn>24.19.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v24.19.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.0359em;">v</span><span class="mord">24.19.0</span></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td>Git</td><td>任意较新版本，本机为 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.55.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2.55.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2.55.0</span></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td>GitHub 账号</td><td>注册免费账号即可</td></tr></tbody></table><p>安装完成后在终端确认：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">node -v<br>npm -v<br>git --version<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="三、创建-GitHub-仓库">三、创建 GitHub 仓库</h2><p>登录 GitHub，点击右上角 <code>+</code> → <strong>New repository</strong>，然后二选一：</p><ol><li><strong>项目站（推荐新手）</strong>：仓库名随便取，例如 <code>myblog</code>，公开（Public）。<br>访问地址形如 <code>https://&lt;用户名&gt;.github.io/myblog/</code>。</li><li><strong>用户站</strong>：仓库名必须是 <code>&lt;用户名&gt;.github.io</code>。<br>访问地址形如 <code>https://&lt;用户名&gt;.github.io/</code>，此时站点根路径 <code>root</code> 要改成 <code>/</code>。</li></ol><blockquote><p>注意：免费账号的 Pages 对<strong>公开仓库</strong>开放；仓库设为私有后 Pages 需要付费方案。</p></blockquote><p>创建后先不要勾选任何初始化文件（README 之后会自动生成）。</p><h2 id="四、安装与配置-Hexo">四、安装与配置 Hexo</h2><p>本工程就是一份可直接使用的 Hexo 站点，包含主题 Fluid、KaTeX 公式、本地搜索与部署脚本。换到新电脑时只需：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npm install          <span class="hljs-comment"># 安装依赖</span><br>npx hexo server      <span class="hljs-comment"># 本地预览 http://localhost:4000</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>需要从零重建时，官方流程是：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npm install -g hexo-cli      <span class="hljs-comment"># 安装脚手架</span><br>hexo init myblog             <span class="hljs-comment"># 初始化站点</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> myblog &amp;&amp; npm install     <span class="hljs-comment"># 安装依赖</span><br>npm install hexo-deployer-git --save   <span class="hljs-comment"># 部署插件</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="五、关键配置：url-与-root">五、关键配置：url 与 root</h2><p>打开 <code>_config.yml</code>，把占位符改成自己的：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">url:</span> <span class="hljs-string">https://YOURNAME.github.io/myblog</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">root:</span> <span class="hljs-string">/myblog/</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">deploy:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">type:</span> <span class="hljs-string">git</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">repo:</span> <span class="hljs-string">https://github.com/YOURNAME/myblog.git</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">branch:</span> <span class="hljs-string">gh-pages</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里 <code>root</code> 必须与「仓库名」一致，否则线上会出现 CSS、图片全部 404 的经典问题。写成用户站时，<code>root</code> 填 <code>/</code>。</p><h2 id="六、写文章">六、写文章</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npx hexo new <span class="hljs-string">&quot;我的第二篇文章&quot;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>会在 <code>source/_posts/</code> 生成 Markdown 文件，开头是 front-matter：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-meta">---</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">title:</span> <span class="hljs-string">我的第二篇文章</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">date:</span> <span class="hljs-number">2026-11-01 10:00:00</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">categories:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">随笔</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">tags:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">生活</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">---</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>正文用 Markdown 写，<code>&lt;!-- more --&gt;</code> 之前的内容会作为首页摘要。</p><h2 id="七、发布上线">七、发布上线</h2><p>本工程提供了两个一键脚本：</p><ul><li><code>publish.ps1</code>：PowerShell 版，可传参数，例如 <code>.\publish.ps1 -Repo https://github.com/me/myblog.git</code></li><li><code>publish.cmd</code>：双击即可的批处理版（内部直接调用 <code>publish.ps1</code>）</li></ul><p>脚本内部等价于：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">npx hexo clean &amp;&amp; npx hexo generate   <span class="hljs-comment"># 清空并重新生成 public/</span><br>npx hexo deploy                       <span class="hljs-comment"># 把 public/ 推到 gh-pages 分支</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>首次推送会要求输入 GitHub 用户名和 <strong>Personal Access Token</strong>（不要用登录密码）。</p><h2 id="八、开启-GitHub-Pages">八、开启 GitHub Pages</h2><p>推送成功后：</p><ol><li>打开仓库 → <strong>Settings</strong> → 左侧 <strong>Pages</strong></li><li><strong>Source</strong> 选择 <em>Deploy from a branch</em></li><li><strong>Branch</strong> 选 <code>gh-pages</code>，目录选 <code>/ (root)</code>，点击 <strong>Save</strong></li><li>等待约 1 分钟，页面顶部会显示站点地址</li></ol><p>之后每次 <code>publish</code>，GitHub Pages 都会自动重新发布，一般几十秒后生效。</p><h2 id="九、绑定自定义域名（可选）">九、绑定自定义域名（可选）</h2><p>如果你有自己的域名：</p><ol><li>在 <code>source/</code> 下新建文件 <code>CNAME</code>，内容只有一行域名，例如 <code>blog.example.com</code></li><li>在域名服务商添加 CNAME 记录，指向 <code>&lt;用户名&gt;.github.io</code></li><li>在仓库 Settings → Pages 中勾选 <strong>Enforce HTTPS</strong></li></ol><h2 id="十、常见问题">十、常见问题</h2><p><strong>Q1：刷新 404 / 页面样式错乱？</strong><br>八成是 <code>url</code> 与 <code>root</code> 没和仓库名对齐，改完务必 <code>npx hexo clean</code> 再重新生成。</p><p><strong>Q2：推送失败 <code>Authentication failed</code>？</strong><br>GitHub 已禁用密码认证，请到 Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens 生成 token，勾选 <code>repo</code> 权限后作为密码输入。</p><p><strong>Q3：公式不显示？</strong><br>本工程已用 <code>markdown-it</code> + KaTeX 在构建期渲染，无需前端 JS。注意行内公式写成 <code>$x$</code> 且美元符号紧贴内容，块级公式的 <code>$$</code> 必须独占一行、前后留空行。</p><p><strong>Q4：文章图片怎么放？</strong><br><code>post_asset_folder: true</code> 已开启，<code>hexo new &quot;标题&quot;</code> 会同时生成同名文件夹，把图片放进去，正文写 <code>![](图片名.png)</code> 即可。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;本文记录这套博客从零到上线的完整流程，适合完全没接触过 Hexo 的人照做。&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
    
    
    
